# Kept out of the theme archive and out of `shopify theme push`.
# Shopify only accepts the standard theme directories; anything else here is
# repo/tooling material for the theme author, not for the merchant's store.
#
# Patterns use `dir/*` rather than `dir/` — the CLI matches the former
# reliably and warns about the latter.

bin/*
demo/*
# `dir/*` matches one level, so the generated imagery needs saying separately.
# It is ~13 MB and belongs in the store's Files, never in the theme archive.
demo/images/*
docs/*
.github/*
.claude/*
node_modules/*

README.md
CHANGELOG.md
.prettierrc.json
.theme-check.yml
